  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Sweat in style with Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Camo Workout Performance Tank Top, designed to keep you comfortable during intense workouts while adding a touch of flair with its camo patterns. Crafted from lightweight, moisture-wicking fabric, this tank top keeps you cool and dry, even during your toughest fitness routines. The racerback style not only offers enhanced support but also fits perfectly with most sports bras, making it ideal for activities like running, yoga, cycling, and weight lifting.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "1265",
  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sweat in style with Rothco&rsquo;s Women&rsquo;s Camo Workout Performance Tank Top, designed to keep you comfortable during intense workouts while adding a touch of flair with its camo patterns. Crafted from lightweight, moisture-wicking fabric, this tank top keeps you cool and dry, even during your toughest fitness routines. The racerback style not only offers enhanced support but also fits perfectly with most sports bras, making it ideal for activities like running, yoga, cycling, and weight lifting. Whether you&rsquo;re hitting the gym or running errands afterward, this versatile top is built to perform and designed to impress. Available in a variety of camo patterns, you can pair it with matching yoga pants or sports bras from Rothco&rsquo;s collection for a complete workout look.</p>",
